apns.h1_f:
POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/device/<device_token>
Cabeçalhos: apns-topic: <bundle_id>, apns-push-type: alerta, apns-collapse-id: room:42
Corpo: {aps: {alert: {title, body}}, dados: <sealed>}

bmp.h1_f:
mailbox_id = HKDF(recipient_pubkey, info="bmp-v1", len=32)
Depósito: POST /bmp/deposit {mailbox_id, blob ≤1MB}
Captura: GET /bmp/messages (autorizado)

